[9.638724, "o", "  # DKG RAG Pipeline Demo 2026-10-15\r\n\r\nThis document demonstrates the DKG RAG pipeline against a live local DKG V10 node.\r\n\r\nKey fact: the OriginTrail DKG V10 node in this demo runs on Base Sepolia testnet...\r\n"]
[9.63894, "o", "\r\n[0.3392] did:dkg:context-graph:openclaw-curator/assertion/0xebDc3D25487E5B28bbd5eD4d5cF59A9c7c46395A/dkg-rag-mv950qvh-6mfa - /home/chovy/rag-demo-corpus/demo_doc_20261015.md (chunk 1/2)\r\n  y citation."]
[9.638983, "o", "\r\n\r\nThe pipeline itself has zero runtime dependencies and defaults to a fully local\r\nembedding provider (character n-gram TF vector); no external API keys are needed.\r\n\r\n"]
[9.639217, "o", "\r\n"]
